---
source: crates/biome_html_analyze/tests/spec_tests.rs
expression: valid.html
---
# Input
```html
<!-- Valid: single variants -->
<div class="hover:bg-red-500"></div>
<div class="focus:text-white"></div>
<div class="sm:flex"></div>

<!-- Valid: separate responsive variants (different classes) -->
<div class="sm:flex md:block lg:hidden"></div>

<!-- Valid: combining different types of variants -->
<div class="hover:focus:bg-red-500"></div>
<div class="sm:hover:flex"></div>
<div class="group-hover:text-white"></div>
<div class="group-hover:peer-focus:text-white"></div>

<!-- Valid: responsive + positional (different categories) -->
<div class="sm:first:flex"></div>
<div class="md:odd:bg-gray-100"></div>

<!-- Valid: theme + state variants -->
<div class="dark:hover:bg-gray-800"></div>
<div class="dark:focus:text-white"></div>

<!-- Valid: different responsive and max-responsive -->
<div class="sm:max-md:flex"></div>

<!-- Valid: no variants at all -->
<div class="flex p-4 m-2"></div>

<!-- Valid: arbitrary variants -->
<div class="[&:hover]:bg-red-500"></div>
<div class="[@media(min-width:400px)]:flex"></div>

```
